<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Project Sdk="Dalamud.NET.Sdk/15.0.0">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>0.4.0.3</Version>
    <Author>Deepseek</Author>
    <Name>Desynth Lens</Name>
    <Punchline>Tracks what your desynths actually yield and what it is worth.</Punchline>
    <Description>Records what each desynthesis actually gives you and what those items are worth.

The desynthesis window shows the real result, so the plugin reads it from the game rather than guessing from a datamined table - those tables do not exist in a reliable form. Each item then keeps a small ledger: how often you desynthesised it, the average and best value of the yield, and the last result.</Description>
    <RepoUrl>https://github.com/KazimeirzOdnowiciel/ffxiv-plugins</RepoUrl>
    <Tags>desynth;market;gil;universalis;ledger</Tags>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
